# fixture: the cross-repo profile-parent target for the main repo's own
# profiles/default/parent "overlay:crossrepo-parent" entry (real
# LocationsManager._expand_parent_colon / get_location_for_name). This
# directory contributes nothing to the resolved config -- its whole job
# is to prove `emerge --pretend` still resolves a `reponame:path` parent
# reference end to end (a broken resolver errors with "not a directory").
# It USED to also carry a license_groups file, back when license_groups
# was (wrongly) read per profile-chain level; that mechanism moved to
# each repo's profiles/ base (see profiles/license_groups), so the file
# is gone and only this resolution-guard marker remains.
